      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So you will go...!\r\nTo vanquish the Phindymian Ent—the very bane that\r\ndestroyed the village that once stood in Elan—",
        "Jp" : "行ってくださるのですね！\r\nかつてエランにあった村を滅ぼした元凶である\r\nフィンダーエントの討伐に――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516416,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ridding the land of this threat... 'twill serve\r\nas the very foundation that brings the\r\nvillage's revival to verity.",
        "Jp" : "この脅威の排除こそ\r\n村の復興を実現させるための\r\n礎になることでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552297,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Dílis is even now gathering word of the\r\nPhindymian Ent's whereabouts— 'Tis a monster of\r\nvast size; its movements can be surmised from the\r\nvery stirrings of the beasts about it.",
        "Jp" : "フィンダーエントが今どこにいるかは\r\nディリスが情報を集めています\r\n――大きな魔物ですから、その動向は\r\n獣たちの動きなどからも推測できるのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552299,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "A foe formidable enough to have\r\nrazed a whole village...\r\nYet I believe, Ser Arisen, that you shall surely\r\nbring that monster to ruin.",
        "Jp" : "村を一つ滅ぼすほどの\r\n手強い相手ではありますが――\r\nわたしは、覚者様ならきっとかの魔物を\r\n排除できると信じておりますわ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552298,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
