      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Phindymian Ent, now... it seems to have\r\nsettled around <SPOT 935> and shows\r\nno sign of moving.",
        "Jp" : "フィンダーエントなら\r\nどうやら《<SPOT 935>》の辺りに\r\n落ち着いて、動く気は無いみたい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516419,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, pray — subjugate the Phindymian\r\nEnt, and return safe.\r\nSomeday, I would see the Elan village revived —\r\ntogether with my elder sister, and\r\nwith you, Ser Arisen.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様、どうかフィンダーエントを討伐して\r\n無事に戻ってきてね\r\nいつかエランの村が復興するのを\r\nお姉様や覚者様と一緒に見たいの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 553269,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 559,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Dílis",
      "Jp" : "ディリス"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19349,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Huh!? You've already destroyed\r\nthe Phindymian Ent!?",
        "Jp" : "えっ！？　もうフィンダーエントを\r\n討伐してきてくださったのですか！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516420,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I had thought it a far longer campaign— But then,\r\n'tis the Arisen we speak of!\r\nYour safe return... truly, 'tis\r\na joy beyond measure.",
        "Jp" : "もっと長丁場になるものと思っておりましたが\r\n――さすがは覚者様ですわ！\r\n無事のお戻り、本当に喜ばしいことです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552869,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah— Now that the Phindymian Ent has been\r\nvanquished... should we revive the village here\r\nin Elan, we need no longer fear it being\r\ncrushed anew, do we?",
        "Jp" : "ああ――\r\nあのフィンダーエントを排除できたということは\r\nこのエランに村を再興しても\r\nもう潰される心配はないのですね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552337,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This shall be inscribed as a momentous event in\r\nthe history of the Elan Water Grove — Ser Arisen,\r\nof course, together with your name—",
        "Jp" : "このことは、エラン水林の歴史に刻まれる\r\n大きな出来事となることでしょう\r\n覚者様、もちろんあなた様のお名前と共に――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552338,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As guardian of the Elan Water Grove, 'tis here I\r\nconvey my utmost gratitude. Your\r\naid — truly, thank you.",
        "Jp" : "エラン水林の守り人として\r\nここに最大限の感謝を表します\r\nお力添え、本当にありがとうございます"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552870,
